provenance.quote:
Shall the measure increasing the rate of the City of Placentia’s existing transient occupancy tax (hotel tax), paid only
by hotel guests, to 14%, funding city services such as police patrols, fire protection, 911 response, and road repairs;
requiring citizen oversight and annual audits, generating about $715,000 annually, until ended by voters, be adopted?

